Package: EcoBiomasBR
Type: Package
Title: Allometric Equations, Biomass, Carbon, Disturbance and Remote Sensing Tools for Brazilian Biomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sabrina", "Castro da Silva", email = "sabrina.castro@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides allometric biomass equations, carbon conversion, anthropic
    disturbance quantification, climate variable integration, and remote sensing
    (LiDAR/GEDI, SAR/PALSAR) tools specific to each of the six Brazilian biomes
    (Amazônia, Cerrado, Mata Atlântica, Caatinga, Pantanal, Pampa). Functions are
    exposed bilingually in Portuguese and English. Where applicable, allometric
    correction routines for the Amazon biome are imported from the 'ForestR'
    package to avoid duplicating methodology.
License: `use_mit_license()`, `use_gpl3_license()` or friends to pick a license
Encoding: UTF-8
